{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X部分段落的感受词仍然偏密，话句切分也较碎，整体扫读和叙述连贯度不如Y顺畅。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的高亮关键词能迅速抓住每段的心理重点，短句也让人物的矛盾逐步显现；尤其把舍不得被当作自己人的温暖与害怕孤单、是否愿意重新忍受委屈联系起来，人物动机比Y更具体。X的感受描写也明显更细腻，能把音乐中的节奏、音色、力度变化与心理活动对应起来；Y胜在叙述连贯和整体扫读轻松，但部分感受被概括得比较笼统，失去了一些音乐与人物情绪之间的微妙联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7621027a-e8cb-45ac-8b2d-a31ad3dfb4dc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T162938344327Z", "elapsed_seconds": 136.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:31:54.371434+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "80da4a4a29b4bf81954b98d6413f35e791c82af0e2eeb3ca126829a7268bdf35", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf